00:47:32,280 --> 00:47:36,440
 on the sequence length. So, if you make the sequence length by having characters say five

512
00:47:36,440 --> 00:47:41,440
 times longer your model training time and inference time will become almost 25 times

513
00:47:41,440 --> 00:47:47,400
 longer. So, that is prohibitive. So, we needed some other solutions. So, that is where this

