00:48:54,360 --> 00:48:59,160
 have like the KE as a pattern that is repeating in the vocab. So, what byte pair encoding

527
00:48:59,160 --> 00:49:03,680
 does is that it essentially figures out all such patterns that occur frequently in the

528
00:49:03,680 --> 00:49:09,680
 dataset and just creates a vocab out of that. Now, you can intuitively think that what kind

